{"id": "en_blackout_city_p1", "total": 80.03, "segments": [{"text": "If the city power cuts out completely, do not light a single candle inside your room.", "start": 0.0, "end": 4.16}, {"text": "Candles cause dangerous house fires during blackouts, and Jack knows the grid will stay dead for days.", "start": 4.72, "end": 8.98}, {"text": "Suddenly, every skyscraper window goes completely pitch black across the entire downtown skyline at 10 PM.", "start": 9.62, "end": 14.68}, {"text": "Jack immediately moves away from the pitch black streets and walks toward his tall office building shelter.", "start": 15.4, "end": 19.34}, {"text": "Panicked drivers honk on gridlocked roads, but Jack keeps moving fast toward safety.", "start": 20.127, "end": 23.64}, {"text": "He reaches the heavy lobby doors and steps safely inside the fortified building.", "start": 24.22, "end": 27.32}, {"text": "One. Store water early by filling every container and bathtub while the water taps still work.", "start": 27.84, "end": 32.56}, {"text": "Gravity tanks empty fast during a blackout, so Jack secures clean emergency drinking water immediately.", "start": 33.22, "end": 37.66}, {"text": "Two. Use battery flashlights for illumination instead of matches because open flames trigger deadly building fires.", "start": 38.42, "end": 43.62}, {"text": "Jack clicks on his durable LED flashlight, lighting the dark interior without risking any fire danger.", "start": 44.26, "end": 48.58}, {"text": "Three. Keep the fridge and freezer shut tight to preserve every ounce of your perishable food.", "start": 49.18, "end": 53.12}, {"text": "A closed fridge keeps food safe for about 4 hours, and a full freezer lasts 48 hours.", "start": 53.12, "end": 57.56}, {"text": "Jack also knows to never run a generator, grill, or camp stove indoors because carbon monoxide kills silently.", "start": 58.2, "end": 63.28}, {"text": "He has clean water, safe battery light, and cold rations secured inside his locked high-rise office.", "start": 63.94, "end": 68.58}, {"text": "It was the perfect blackout survival plan, but there was just one terrible problem.", "start": 69.18, "end": 72.88}, {"text": "Heavy smoke begins pouring from under the stairwell door, and all exit alarms are dead.", "start": 73.46, "end": 76.88}], "words": [["If", 0.0, 0.28], ["the", 0.28, 0.4], ["city", 0.4, 0.6], ["power", 0.6, 0.86], ["cuts", 0.86, 1.1], ["out", 1.1, 1.22], ["completely,", 1.22, 1.66], ["do", 2.06, 2.16], ["not", 2.16, 2.42], ["light", 2.42, 2.64], ["a", 2.64, 2.82], ["single", 2.82, 3.12], ["candle", 3.12, 3.46], ["inside", 3.46, 3.76], ["your", 3.76, 3.94], ["room.", 3.94, 4.16], ["Candles", 4.72, 5.12], ["cause", 5.12, 5.3], ["dangerous", 5.3, 5.68], ["house", 5.68, 6.02], ["fires", 6.02, 6.24], ["during", 6.24, 6.5], ["blackouts,", 6.5, 6.88], ["and", 7.26, 7.34], ["Jack", 7.34, 7.52], ["knows", 7.52, 7.86], ["the", 7.86, 8.1], ["grid", 8.1, 8.22], ["will", 8.22, 8.34], ["stay", 8.34, 8.5], ["dead", 8.5, 8.64], ["for", 8.64, 8.78], ["days.", 8.78, 8.98], ["Suddenly,", 9.62, 9.98], ["every", 10.44, 10.68], ["skyscraper", 10.68, 11.16], ["window", 11.16, 11.4], ["goes", 11.4, 11.62], ["completely", 11.62, 12.04], ["pitch", 12.04, 12.36], ["black", 12.36, 12.54], ["across", 12.54, 12.86], ["the", 12.86, 13.02], ["entire", 13.02, 13.4], ["downtown", 13.4, 13.74], ["skyline", 13.74, 14.2], ["at", 14.2, 14.32], ["10", 14.32, 14.46], ["PM.", 14.46, 14.68], ["Jack", 15.4, 15.72], ["immediately", 15.72, 16.04], ["moves", 16.04, 16.34], ["away", 16.34, 16.54], ["from", 16.54, 16.68], ["the", 16.68, 16.76], ["pitch", 16.76, 16.92], ["black", 16.92, 17.08], ["streets", 17.08, 17.34], ["and", 17.34, 17.76], ["walks", 17.76, 17.94], ["toward", 17.94, 18.12], ["his", 18.12, 18.3], ["tall", 18.3, 18.48], ["office", 18.48, 18.78], ["building", 18.78, 19.06], ["shelter.", 19.06, 19.34], ["Panicked", 20.127, 20.575], ["drivers", 20.28, 20.54], ["honk", 20.54, 20.82], ["on", 20.82, 20.98], ["gridlocked", 20.98, 21.48